{"verse_key": "72:1", "surah": 72, "verse": 1, "text_uthmani": " قُلْ أُوحِىَ إِلَىَّ أَنَّهُ ٱسْتَمَعَ نَفَرٌ مِّنَ ٱلْجِنِّ فَقَالُوٓا۟ إِنَّا سَمِعْنَا قُرْءَانًا عَجَبًا", "translation": "Say, [O Muḥammad], \"It has been revealed to me that a group of the jinn listened and said, 'Indeed, we have heard an amazing Qur’ān [i.e., recitation].", "verse_from_ms": 0, "verse_to_ms": 13650, "audio_url": "https://download.quranicaudio.com/qdc/khalifah_taniji/murattal/72.mp3", "words": [{"i": 0, "text": "قُلْ", "start_ms": 0, "end_ms": 600}, {"i": 1, "text": "أُوحِىَ", "start_ms": 600, "end_ms": 1370}, {"i": 2, "text": "إِلَىَّ", "start_ms": 1370, "end_ms": 2130}, {"i": 3, "text": "أَنَّهُ", "start_ms": 2130, "end_ms": 3380}, {"i": 4, "text": "ٱسْتَمَعَ", "start_ms": 3380, "end_ms": 4230}, {"i": 5, "text": "نَفَرٌ", "start_ms": 4230, "end_ms": 4940}, {"i": 6, "text": "مِّنَ", "start_ms": 4940, "end_ms": 5740}, {"i": 7, "text": "ٱلْجِنِّ", "start_ms": 5740, "end_ms": 7000}, {"i": 8, "text": "فَقَالُوٓا۟", "start_ms": 7000, "end_ms": 8899}, {"i": 9, "text": "إِنَّا", "start_ms": 8900, "end_ms": 10080}, {"i": 10, "text": "سَمِعْنَا", "start_ms": 10080, "end_ms": 11100}, {"i": 11, "text": "قُرْءَانًا", "start_ms": 11100, "end_ms": 12280}, {"i": 12, "text": "عَجَبًا", "start_ms": 12280, "end_ms": 13565}]}